# The phone's Gatos app (W5, S24) over NAV at acme: every villager with its state, room and mark
# (api-gateway "!", alpha "zZ"); then enter on api-gateway opens its actions (ir até, conversar,
# sentar no terminal, responder, parar, renomear, mover de contexto, arquivar). User-approval shot.
key J
wait 600
inject overlay {"phone":{"app":"gatos"}}
wait 400
expect json /ext/overlay/phone/app "gatos"
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-phone-gatos.png
key j
key Return
wait 400
expect json /ext/overlay/phone/sub "3"
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-phone-gatos-acoes.png
dump ${OUT}/dump-cats-phone-gatos.json
quit
